   273                              <1> ; bu_memshow -- memory count (replaces AMI's "nnnnnn KB OK")
   274                              <1> ;   In: AX = 64 KB blocks counted, DX = blocks still to go in this
   275                              <1> ;       pass, BP = first block of the pass (1 = base memory, 0Ah = 640K-1M,
   276                              <1> ;       10h = above 1 MB)
